 (if (v+1)%2=0 then true else GroupKernel80909.per r v code q lo hi start p (2*((v+1)/2)))
lemma inner_eq(r v code q lo hi start:ℕ)(p:Piece)
 (hq:10≤q)(hQ:q≤19)(hv:v≤70)(hcut:hi≤4000)(hlo:lo≤hi):
 inner r v code q lo hi start p=allK (GroupKernel80909.per r v code q lo hi start p) (v+1):=by
